7. What is the output? Explain yield.
int x = 8;
String result = switch (x) {
    case 10, 9 -> "A";
    case 8 -> {
        String grade = "B";
        System.out.println("Processing grade B");
        yield grade;
    }
    default -> "C or below";
};
System.out.println("Result: " + result);

